  { t: "num", m: 3, q: "Calculate ΔH<sub>f</sub> of ethane from ΔH<sub>c</sub>: C −394, H<sub>2</sub> −286, C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub> −1560 kJ mol<sup>−1</sup>.", ans: -86, unit: "kJ mol⁻¹", ms: [R`2C + 3H<sub>2</sub> → C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>6</sub> (1)`, R`\(2(-394) + 3(-286) - (-1560)\) (1)`, R`\(= -86\ \text{kJ}\,\text{mol}^{-1}\) (1)`] }
